{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I will bring distress upon mankind</b> — that they are in fortified cities." "<b>And I will pour out their blood</b> — in abundance, like dust." "<b>And their flesh like dung</b> — their flesh in the language of Ishmael; and like it: 'and rain upon them their flesh' [Arabic]." "<b>Like dung</b> — like in 'the dung of human excrement.'"], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:24.720878589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}